y: HCI Poppy; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조\" lang=\"EN-US\">2014. 2. 3(월) 10 : 00 ~ 2. 10(월) 23 : 59까지</span></p><p style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: center\" class=\"바탕글\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조; COLOR: #0000ff; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; mso-hansi-font-family: HCI Poppy; mso-ascii-font-family: HCI Poppy\">※ 위 기간 경과 후에는 학사서비스센터로 직접 방문 신청하여야 함.</span></p></td></tr><tr><td style=\"BORDER-BOTTOM: #000000 0.28pt solid; BORDER-LEFT: #000000 1.7pt solid; LINE-HEIGHT: 1.8; WIDTH: 68.09pt; HEIGHT: 19.48pt; BORDER-TOP: #000000 0.28pt solid; BORDER-RIGHT: #000000 0.28pt solid\" valign=\"center\"><p style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: center\" class=\"바탕글\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-hansi-font-family: HCI Poppy; mso-ascii-font-family: HCI Poppy\">신청방법</span></p></td><td style=\"BORDER-BOTTOM: #000000 0.28pt solid; BORDER-LEFT: #000000 0.28pt solid; LINE-HEIGHT: 1.8; WIDTH: 453.31pt; HEIGHT: 19.48pt; BORDER-TOP: #000000 0.28pt solid; BORDER-RIGHT: #000000 1.7pt solid\" valign=\"center\" colspan=\"3\"><p style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: center\" class=\"바탕글\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조; COLOR: #282828; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-hansi-font-family: HCI Poppy; mso-ascii-font-family: HCI Poppy\">홈페이지→원스톱서비스 로그인→학적→휴학신청접수</span></p></td></tr><tr><td style=\"BORDER-BOTTOM: #000000 0.28pt solid; BORDER-LEFT: #000000 1.7pt solid; LINE-HEIGHT: 1.8; WIDTH: 68.09pt; HEIGHT: 68.5pt; BORDER-TOP: #000000 0.28pt solid; BORDER-RIGHT: #000000 0.28pt solid\" valign=\"center\" rowspan=\"2\"><p style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: center\" class=\"바탕글\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-hansi-font-family: HCI Poppy; mso-ascii-font-family: HCI Poppy\">제출서류</span></p></td><td style=\"BORDER-BOTTOM: #000000 0.28pt solid; BORDER-LEFT: #000000 0.28pt solid; LINE-HEIGHT: 1.8; WIDTH: 68.09pt; HEIGHT: 68.5pt; BORDER-TOP: #000000 0.28pt solid; BORDER-RIGHT: #000000 0.28pt solid\" valign=\"center\" rowspan=\"2\"><p style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: center\" class=\"바탕글\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-hansi-font-family: HCI Poppy; mso-ascii-font-family: HCI Poppy\">없음</span></p></td><td style=\"BORDER-BOTTOM: #000000 0.28pt solid; BORDER-LEFT: #000000 0.28pt solid; LINE-HEIGHT: 1.8; WIDTH: 291.66pt; HEIGHT: 25.76pt; BORDER-TOP: #000000 0.28pt solid; BORDER-RIGHT: #000000 0.28pt solid\" valign=\"center\"><p style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: center\" class=\"바탕글\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-hansi-font-family: HCI Poppy; mso-ascii-font-family: HCI Poppy\">군입영통지서 사본 or 군복무확인서 사본</span></p></td><td style=\"BORDER-BOTTOM: #000000 0.28pt solid; BORDER-LEFT: #000000 0.28pt solid; LINE-HEIGHT: 1.8; WIDTH: 93.56pt; HEIGHT: 25.76pt; BORDER-TOP: #000000 0.28pt solid; BORDER-RIGHT: #000000 1.7pt solid\" valign=\"center\"><p style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: center\" class=\"바탕글\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: HCI Poppy; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-hansi-font-family: HCI Poppy; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조\" lang=\"EN-US\">4주 이상 진단서</span></p></td></tr><tr><td style=\"BORDER-BOTTOM: #000000 0.28pt solid; BORDER-LEFT: #000000 0.28pt solid; LINE-HEIGHT: 1.8; WIDTH: 291.66pt; HEIGHT: 42.74pt; BORDER-TOP: #000000 0.28pt solid; BORDER-RIGHT: #000000 0.28pt solid\" valign=\"center\"><p class=\"바탕글\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: HCI Poppy; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-hansi-font-family: HCI Poppy; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조\" lang=\"EN-US\">&nbsp;1. 학번, 연락처를 기재하여 휴학신청 당일 제출.</span></p><p class=\"바탕글\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: HCI Poppy; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-hansi-font-family: HCI Poppy; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조\" lang=\"EN-US\">&nbsp;2. </span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조; COLOR: #0000ff; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; mso-hansi-font-family: HCI Poppy; mso-ascii-font-family: HCI Poppy\">서류 미제출자는 3일후 휴학신청 자동 취소됨.</span></p></td><td style=\"BORDER-BOTTOM: #000000 0.28pt solid; BORDER-LEFT: #000000 0.28pt solid; LINE-HEIGHT: 1.8; WIDTH: 93.56pt; HEIGHT: 42.74pt; BORDER-TOP: #000000 0.28pt solid; BORDER-RIGHT: #000000 1.7pt solid\" valign=\"center\"><p class=\"바탕글\">&nbsp;</p></td></tr><tr><td style=\"BORDER-BOTTOM: #000000 0.28pt solid; BORDER-LEFT: #000000 1.7pt solid; LINE-HEIGHT: 1.8; WIDTH: 68.09pt; HEIGHT: 72.28pt; BORDER-TOP: #000000 0.28pt solid; BORDER-RIGHT: #000000 0.28pt solid\" valign=\"center\"><p style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: center\" class=\"바탕글\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-hansi-font-family: HCI Poppy; mso-ascii-font-family: HCI Poppy\">제출장소</span></p></td><td style=\"BORDER-BOTTOM: #000000 0.28pt solid; BORDER-LEFT: #000000 0.28pt solid; LINE-HEIGHT: 1.8; WIDTH: 453.31pt; HEIGHT: 72.28pt; BORDER-TOP: #000000 0.28pt solid; BORDER-RIGHT: #000000 1.7pt solid\" valign=\"center\" colspan=\"3\"><p class=\"바탕글\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: HCI Poppy; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-hansi-font-family: HCI Poppy; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조\" lang=\"EN-US\">&nbsp;1. 학생회관 1층 (학사서비스센터 : 18시 까지) or 팩스(24시 까지, 054-478-7069)</span></p><p class=\"바탕글\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: HCI Poppy; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-hansi-font-family: HCI Poppy; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조\" lang=\"EN-US\">&nbsp;2. 팩스로 제출한 학생 중 신청 2~3일 이후 처리가 되어 있지 않은 학생은 팩스 도착</span></p><p class=\"바탕글\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: HCI Poppy; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-hansi-font-family: HCI Poppy; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조\" lang=\"EN-US\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; 여부를 반드시 확인 바람(☎ 054-478-7066)</span></p><p class=\"바탕글\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: HCI Poppy; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-hansi-font-family: HCI Poppy; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조\" lang=\"EN-US\">&nbsp;* 군입대휴학 후, 귀향조치 및 입영 거부된 학생은 즉시 학사서비스센터로 연락 바람.</span></p></td></tr><tr><td style=\"BORDER-BOTTOM: #000000 1.7pt solid; BORDER-LEFT: #000000 1.7pt solid; LINE-HEIGHT: 1.8; WIDTH: 68.09pt; HEIGHT: 72.28pt; BORDER-TOP: #000000 0.28pt solid; BORDER-RIGHT: #000000 0.28pt solid\" valign=\"center\"><p style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: center\" class=\"바탕글\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-hansi-font-family: HCI Poppy; mso-ascii-font-family: HCI Poppy\">확정여부</span></p></td><td style=\"BORDER-BOTTOM: #000000 1.7pt solid; BORDER-LEFT: #000000 0.28pt solid; LINE-HEIGHT: 1.8; WIDTH: 453.31pt; HEIGHT: 72.28pt; BORDER-TOP: #000000 0.28pt solid; BORDER-RIGHT: #000000 1.7pt solid\" valign=\"center\" colspan=\"3\"><p class=\"바탕글\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: HCI Poppy; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-hansi-font-family: HCI Poppy; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조\" lang=\"EN-US\">&nbsp;1. 확정절차 : </span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-hansi-font-family: HCI Poppy; mso-ascii-font-family: HCI Poppy\">휴학 신청 후 당일 지정서류 제출 → 해당 학부(과)</span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-hansi-font-family: HCI Poppy; mso-ascii-font-family: HCI Poppy\">별 명단 송부</span></p><p class=\"바탕글\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: HCI Poppy; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-hansi-font-family: HCI Poppy; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조\" lang=\"EN-US\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; (지도교수 확인) → 최종확정 → 확인</span></p><p class=\"바탕글\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: HCI Poppy; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-hansi-font-family: HCI Poppy; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조\" lang=\"EN-US\">&nbsp;2. 확정일자 : 신청 후 2일 이내 확정</span></p><p class=\"바탕글\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: HCI Poppy; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-hansi-font-family: HCI Poppy; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조\" lang=\"EN-US\">&nbsp;3. </span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; mso-hansi-font-family: HCI Poppy; mso-ascii-font-family: HCI Poppy\">확정확인</span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: HCI Poppy; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-hansi-font-family: HCI Poppy; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조\" lang=\"EN-US\"> : </span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-hansi-font-family: HCI Poppy; mso-ascii-font-family: HCI Poppy\">원스톱서비스 로그인 → 학적부 → 학적자료조회 → 학적변동</span></p></td></tr></tbody></table><p></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.8\" class=\"바탕글\">&nbsp;</p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.8\" class=\"바탕글\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Arial\">※ </span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Arial; COLOR: #282828; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-hansi-font-family: HCI Poppy; mso-ascii-font-family: HCI Poppy\">군입대휴학을 원하나 </span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Arial; COLOR: #ff0000; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-hansi-font-family: HCI Poppy; mso-ascii-font-family: HCI Poppy\">입영통지서가 아직 나오지 않은 학생</span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Arial; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-hansi-font-family: HCI Poppy; mso-ascii-font-family: HCI Poppy\">은&nbsp;</span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Arial; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-hansi-font-family: HCI Poppy; mso-ascii-font-family: HCI Poppy\">우선 일반휴학을 신청하고 </span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.8\" class=\"바탕글\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Arial; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-hansi-font-family: HCI Poppy; mso-ascii-font-family: HCI Poppy\">&nbsp;&nbsp; 입영통지서가 나오는 즉시 팩스만 보내주시면 일반휴학에서 군입대휴학으로 변경됩니다.</span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.8\" class=\"바탕글\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Arial; FONT-SIZE: 11pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp; ⇒ 수업일수 4분의 3선(2014.05.20.)이전 군입대자에 한함</span></p><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Arial; FONT-SIZE: 11pt\"><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.8\" class=\"바탕글\">&nbsp;</p></span><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.8\" class=\"바탕글\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Arial\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Arial\">※ 유의사항</span></span></span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.8\" class=\"바탕글\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Arial\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Arial\">1. 일반휴학 허가는 수업일수 1/4선(2014년 3월 28일)까지만 허용. </span></span></span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.8\" class=\"바탕글\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Arial\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Arial\">2. </span></span></span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Arial; FONT-SIZE: 11pt\"><u style=\"FONT-FAMILY: null; text-underline: #000000 single\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조; mso-hansi-font-family: HCI Poppy; mso-ascii-font-family: HCI Poppy\">휴학생도 2월 24일부터 27일까지 등록금 납부 가능.</span></u></span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.8\" class=\"바탕글\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Arial\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Arial\">&nbsp;&nbsp; <u>(납부기간경과 후 납부할 수 없으며 장학금혜택도 받을 수 없음).</u></span></span></span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.8\" class=\"바탕글\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Arial\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Arial\">3. 휴학생은 수강신청 불가.</span></span></span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 2\" class=\"바탕글\">&nbsp;</p><div style=\"WIDTH: 99%; BACKGROUND: url(http://www.kumoh.ac.kr/webeditor/images/deco/line05.gif?rv=1.0.1) repeat-x left 50%; HEIGHT: 15px\"><hr style=\"BORDER-BOTTOM: black 0px; POSITION: relative; BORDER-LEFT: black 0px; BORDER-TOP: black 0px; TOP: -999px; BORDER-RIGHT: black 0px; LEFT: -999px\"></div><p>&nbsp;</p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 2\" class=\"바탕글\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: HCI Poppy; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-hansi-font-family: HCI Poppy; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조\" lang=\"EN-US\"><strong><font style=\"BACKGROUND-COLOR: #009999\" color=\"#ffffff\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 14pt\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Arial\">2. 복학 신청(인터넷 신청)</span></span></font></strong></span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 2\" class=\"바탕글\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Arial\">▶ </span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Arial\"><u style=\"FONT-FAMILY: null; text-underline: #0000ff single\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조; COLOR: #0000ff; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-hansi-font-family: HCI Poppy; mso-ascii-font-family: HCI Poppy\">전공 배정 대상자 중 전공 미배정자, 모집단위 폐지 및 신설에 따른 </span></u></span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Arial\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조; COLOR: #0000ff; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-hansi-font-family: HCI Poppy; mso-ascii-font-family: HCI Poppy\"><u>복학 학부(과) 변경 </u></span></span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Arial\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조; COLOR: #0000ff; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-hansi-font-family: HCI Poppy; mso-ascii-font-family: HCI Poppy\"><u>자의 경우 </u></span></span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 2\" class=\"바탕글\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Arial\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조; COLOR: #0000ff; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-hansi-font-family: HCI Poppy; mso-ascii-font-family: HCI Poppy\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; <u>학사안내 공지사항을 참고하여 복학신청을 하시기 바랍니다.</u></span></span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 2\" class=\"바탕글\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Arial\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp; </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\">※ </span></span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Arial; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; mso-hansi-font-family: HCI Poppy; mso-ascii-font-family: HCI Poppy\">학사안내 공지사항 : 2014학년도 1학기 복학생 학과 변경 알림(1월 중 공지 예정)</span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 2\" class=\"바탕글\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Arial\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; - 학부(과) 및 학년별 복학신청 방법 및 학과변경 내역이 기재되어 있사오니, </span></span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 2\" class=\"바탕글\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Arial\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;참고하시어 복학 신청이 원활히 진행되도록 하시기 바랍니다.</span></span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 2\" class=\"바탕글\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Arial\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;- </span></span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Arial; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-hansi-font-family: HCI Poppy; mso-ascii-font-family: HCI Poppy\">전공배정 등과 관련된 사항은 해당 학부(과)에서 상담 받으시기 바랍니다.</span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 2\" class=\"바탕글\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Arial\">▶ 수강신청 및 등록금 납부만으로는 복학처리가 되지 않습니다. </span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 2\" class=\"바탕글\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Arial\">▶ </span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Arial\"><u style=\"FONT-FAMILY: null; text-underline: #0000ff single\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조; COLOR: #0000ff; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-hansi-font-family: HCI Poppy; mso-ascii-font-family: HCI Poppy\">원스톱서비스-학적에 사진이 없거나 사진변경을 원하는 학생</span></u></span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Arial; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-hansi-font-family: HCI Poppy; mso-ascii-font-family: HCI Poppy\">은&nbsp;</span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Arial; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-hansi-font-family: HCI Poppy; mso-ascii-font-family: HCI Poppy\">원스톱서비스에서 </span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 2\" class=\"바탕글\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Arial; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-hansi-font-family: HCI Poppy; mso-ascii-font-family: HCI Poppy\">&nbsp;&nbsp; 직접 사진을 올리시기 바랍니다.</span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Arial; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-hansi-font-family: HCI Poppy; mso-ascii-font-family: HCI Poppy\">(스캔 혹은 사진관으로부터 파일 전송 받아 사진등록)</span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 2\" class=\"바탕글\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Arial; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-hansi-font-family: HCI Poppy; mso-ascii-font-family: HCI Poppy\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;</span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Arial\">단, 불가피한 사정으로 사진을 원스톱서비스에 올리기 어려운 학생은 3월</span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Arial; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; mso-hansi-font-family: HCI Poppy; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조\" lang=\"EN-US\"> </span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Arial; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-hansi-font-family: HCI Poppy; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조\" lang=\"EN-US\">28일까지 </span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 2\" class=\"바탕글\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Arial; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-hansi-font-family: HCI Poppy; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조\" lang=\"EN-US\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;학생회관 1층 학사서비스센터로 사진을 반드시 제출한 후, 지정된 양식에 학번 및 </span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 2\" class=\"바탕글\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Arial; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-hansi-font-family: HCI Poppy; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조\" lang=\"EN-US\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;성명을 기재하여 주시기 바랍니다</span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Arial; COLOR: #ff0000; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-hansi-font-family: HCI Poppy; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조\" lang=\"EN-US\">.</span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 2\" class=\"바탕글\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Arial; COLOR: #ff0000; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-hansi-font-family: HCI Poppy; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조\" lang=\"EN-US\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;(</span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Arial; COLOR: #ff0000; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; mso-hansi-font-family: HCI Poppy; mso-ascii-font-family: HCI Poppy\">사진 미등록학생은 원스톱서비스 사용 및 학사업무 불가</span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Arial; COLOR: #ff0000; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-hansi-font-family: HCI Poppy; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조\" lang=\"EN-US\">)</span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 2; MARGIN-LEFT: 66.6pt\" class=\"바탕글\">&nbsp;</p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 2\" class=\"바탕글\"></p><table style=\"BORDER-BOTTOM: #000000 0.28pt solid; BORDER-LEFT: #000000 0.28pt solid; BORDER-COLLAPSE: collapse; BORDER-TOP: #000000 0.28pt solid; BORDER-RIGHT: #000000 0.28pt solid\"><tbody><tr><td style=\"BORDER-BOTTOM: #000000 0.28pt solid; BORDER-LEFT: #000000 0.28pt solid; WIDTH: 62.66pt; BACKGROUND: #ffff66; HEIGHT: 17.65pt; BORDER-TOP: #000000 0.28pt solid; BORDER-RIGHT: #000000 0.28pt solid\" valign=\"center\"><p style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: center\" class=\"바탕글\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-hansi-font-family: HCI Poppy; mso-ascii-font-family: HCI Poppy\">구분</span></p></td><td style=\"BORDER-BOTTOM: #000000 0.28pt solid; BORDER-LEFT: #000000 0.28pt solid; WIDTH: 413.58pt; BACKGROUND: #ffff66; HEIGHT: 17.65pt; BORDER-TOP: #000000 0.28pt solid; BORDER-RIGHT: #000000 0.28pt solid\" valign=\"center\"><p style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: center\" class=\"바탕글\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-hansi-font-family: HCI Poppy; mso-ascii-font-family: HCI Poppy\">일반 복학 &amp; 군제대 복학 </span></p></td></tr><tr><td style=\"BORDER-BOTTOM: #000000 0.28pt solid; BORDER-LEFT: #000000 0.28pt solid; WIDTH: 62.66pt; HEIGHT: 86.1pt; BORDER-TOP: #000000 0.28pt solid; BORDER-RIGHT: #000000 0.28pt solid\" valign=\"center\" rowspan=\"2\"><p style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: center; LINE-HEIGHT: 1.2\" class=\"바탕글\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-hansi-font-family: HCI Poppy; mso-ascii-font-family: HCI Poppy\">신청기간</span></p></td><td style=\"BORDER-BOTTOM: #000000 0.28pt solid; BORDER-LEFT: #000000 0.28pt solid; LINE-HEIGHT: 1.2; WIDTH: 413.58pt; HEIGHT: 34.25pt; BORDER-TOP: #000000 0.28pt solid; BORDER-RIGHT: #000000 0.28pt solid\" valign=\"center\"><p style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: center\" class=\"바탕글\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: HCI Poppy; COLOR: #0000ff; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; mso-hansi-font-family: HCI Poppy; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조\" lang=\"EN-US\">2014. 2. 3(월) 10 : 00 ~ 2. 10(금) 23 : 59까지</span></p><p style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: center\" class=\"바탕글\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조; COLOR: #0000ff; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; mso-hansi-font-family: HCI Poppy; mso-ascii-font-family: HCI Poppy\">※ 위 기간 경과 후에는 학사서비스센터로 직접 방문 신청하여야 함.</span></p></td></tr><tr><td style=\"BORDER-BOTTOM: #000000 0.28pt solid; BORDER-LEFT: #000000 0.28pt solid; LINE-HEIGHT: 1.2; WIDTH: 413.58pt; HEIGHT: 51.85pt; BORDER-TOP: #000000 0.28pt solid; BORDER-RIGHT: #000000 0.28pt solid\" valign=\"center\"><p style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: left\" class=\"바탕글\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: HCI Poppy; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-hansi-font-family: HCI Poppy; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조\" lang=\"EN-US\">1. 등록금납부는 복학신청 후 2월 24일부터 27일까지 반드시 납부바람.</span></p><p class=\"바탕글\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: HCI Poppy; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-hansi-font-family: HCI Poppy; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조\" lang=\"EN-US\">2. 군제대 복학자의 전역일자가 2014년 3월 28일 이후일 경우에는 학사서비스센터에 문의 바람(☎ 054-478-7066)</span></p></td></tr><tr><td style=\"BORDER-BOTTOM: #000000 0.28pt solid; BORDER-LEFT: #000000 0.28pt solid; LINE-HEIGHT: 1.2; WIDTH: 62.66pt; HEIGHT: 34.25pt; BORDER-TOP: #000000 0.28pt solid; BORDER-RIGHT: #000000 0.28pt solid\" valign=\"center\"><p style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: center\" class=\"바탕글\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-hansi-font-family: HCI Poppy; mso-ascii-font-family: HCI Poppy\">신청방법</span></p></td><td style=\"BORDER-BOTTOM: #000000 0.28pt solid; BORDER-LEFT: #000000 0.28pt solid; LINE-HEIGHT: 1.2; WIDTH: 413.58pt; HEIGHT: 34.25pt; BORDER-TOP: #000000 0.28pt solid; BORDER-RIGHT: #000000 0.28pt solid\" valign=\"center\"><p style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: left\" class=\"바탕글\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: HCI Poppy; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-hansi-font-family: HCI Poppy; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조\" lang=\"EN-US\">1.</span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: HCI Poppy; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-hansi-font-family: HCI Poppy; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조\" lang=\"EN-US\"> </span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조; COLOR: #0000ff; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; mso-hansi-font-family: HCI Poppy; mso-ascii-font-family: HCI Poppy\">홈페이지 → 원스톱서비스 로그인 → 학적 → 복학신청접수</span></p><p style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: left\" class=\"바탕글\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: HCI Poppy; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-hansi-font-family: HCI Poppy; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조\" lang=\"EN-US\">2. 예비군대상자는 정확한 개인 정보를 입력 바람.</span></p></td></tr><tr><td style=\"BORDER-BOTTOM: #000000 0.28pt solid; BORDER-LEFT: #000000 0.28pt solid; LINE-HEIGHT: 1.2; WIDTH: 62.66pt; HEIGHT: 34.25pt; BORDER-TOP: #000000 0.28pt solid; BORDER-RIGHT: #000000 0.28pt solid\" valign=\"center\"><p style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: center\" class=\"바탕글\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-hansi-font-family: HCI Poppy; mso-ascii-font-family: HCI Poppy\">제출서류</span></p></td><td style=\"BORDER-BOTTOM: #000000 0.28pt solid; BORDER-LEFT: #000000 0.28pt solid; LINE-HEIGHT: 1.2; WIDTH: 413.58pt; HEIGHT: 34.25pt; BORDER-TOP: #000000 0.28pt solid; BORDER-RIGHT: #000000 0.28pt solid\" valign=\"center\"><p style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: center\" class=\"바탕글\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-hansi-font-family: HCI Poppy; mso-ascii-font-family: HCI Poppy\">군 제대 후 복학자는 전역 예정증명서 사본 or 전역증 사본 제출 </span></p><p style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: center\" class=\"바탕글\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: HCI Poppy; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-hansi-font-family: HCI Poppy; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조\" lang=\"EN-US\">(</span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; mso-hansi-font-family: HCI Poppy; mso-ascii-font-family: HCI Poppy\">학번, 연락처 기재</span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-hansi-font-family: HCI Poppy; mso-ascii-font-family: HCI Poppy\">바람)⇒학생회관 1층(학사서비스센터) or 팩스(054-478-7069)</span></p></td></tr><tr><td style=\"BORDER-BOTTOM: #000000 0.28pt solid; BORDER-LEFT: #000000 0.28pt solid; LINE-HEIGHT: 1.2; WIDTH: 62.66pt; HEIGHT: 69.45pt; BORDER-TOP: #000000 0.28pt solid; BORDER-RIGHT: #000000 0.28pt solid\" valign=\"center\"><p style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: center\" class=\"바탕글\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-hansi-font-family: HCI Poppy; mso-ascii-font-family: HCI Poppy\">확정여부</span></p></td><td style=\"BORDER-BOTTOM: #000000 0.28pt solid; BORDER-LEFT: #000000 0.28pt solid; LINE-HEIGHT: 1.2; WIDTH: 413.58pt; HEIGHT: 69.45pt; BORDER-TOP: #000000 0.28pt solid; BORDER-RIGHT: #000000 0.28pt solid\" valign=\"center\"><p class=\"바탕글\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: HCI Poppy; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-hansi-font-family: HCI Poppy; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조\" lang=\"EN-US\">1. 확정절차 : 복학신청 → 해당 학부(과)별 명단 송부(지도교수 확인) → 최종확정 → 확인</span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: HCI Poppy; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-hansi-font-family: HCI Poppy; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조\" lang=\"EN-US\">2. 확정일자 : 신청 후 2일 이내 확정</span></p><p class=\"바탕글\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: HCI Poppy; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-hansi-font-family: HCI Poppy; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조\" lang=\"EN-US\">3. </span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; mso-hansi-font-family: HCI Poppy; mso-ascii-font-family: HCI Poppy\">확정확인</span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: HCI Poppy; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-hansi-font-family: HCI Poppy; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조\" lang=\"EN-US\"> : 원스톱서비스 로그인 → 학적부 → 학적자료조회 → 학적변동</span></p></td></tr></tbody></table><p></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 2\" class=\"바탕글\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Arial\">※ 전역증이 없을 경우 초본(<strong>병역 사항 기재되어 있어야 함</strong>) 혹은 전역일이 기재된 병적증명서 제출</span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 2\" class=\"바탕글\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Arial\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Arial\">※&nbsp; </span>복학 허가는 수업일수 1/4선(2014년 3월 28일)까지만 허용됩니다. </span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 2\" class=\"바탕글\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Arial\">※ 등록금 인상분 미납액을 납부하지 않은 학생은 원스톱서비스를 이용한 </span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 2\" class=\"바탕글\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Arial\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; 휴·복학신청 메뉴가 제한됩니다.</span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 2\" class=\"바탕글\">&nbsp;</p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 2\" class=\"바탕글\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Arial\">※ 문의 전화</span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 2\" class=\"바탕글\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Arial\">1) 휴 · 복학 관련 : (054)478-7066 </span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 2\" class=\"바탕글\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Arial\">2) 등 록 금 관련 : 478-7115 </span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 2\" class=\"바탕글\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Arial\">3) 장학·대출관련 : 478-7045, 7065</span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 2\" class=\"바탕글\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Arial\">4) 수강신청 관련 : 478-7029</span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 2\" class=\"바탕글\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Arial\">5) 공학인증 관련 : 478-7881</span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 2\" class=\"바탕글\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Arial\">6) 예 비 군 관련 : 478-7158</span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 2\" class=\"바탕글\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Arial\">7) 원스톱서비스 비밀번호 문의 : 478-7068</span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 2\" class=\"바탕글\">&nbsp;</p><p style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: center; LINE-HEIGHT: 2\" class=\"바탕글\">&nbsp; </p><p style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: center; LINE-HEIGHT: 2\" class=\"바탕글\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: HCI Poppy; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-hansi-font-family: HCI Poppy; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조\" lang=\"EN-US\">2014. 1. 14</span></p><p style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: center; LINE-HEIGHT: 2\" class=\"바탕글\">&nbsp;</p><p style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: center; LINE-HEIGHT: 2\" class=\"바탕글\">&nbsp;</p><p style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: center; LINE-HEIGHT: 2\" class=\"바탕글\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 고딕; FONT-SIZE: 16pt; mso-hansi-font-family: 고딕; mso-ascii-font-family: 고딕\">교 무 처 장</span></p><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Arial\"><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 2\">&nbsp;</p></span>\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n            "}
